{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10106380","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10106380","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1010638001:1":{"text":"What's wrong, Bunny Ears? Is there an issue with the boat?","source_cn":"兔耳朵，怎么了？船有问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EEF4DAD9D2624AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010638002:1":{"text":"Nope, the boat's fine. It's at the docks, hasn't moved since I got here.","source_cn":"没有，它好好的，和我来时一样安稳地在码头睡着呢，就是不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA534D1DFBD60F840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010638003:1":{"text":"Things have been a little messy in the Dark Forest lately. Do you really have to go?","source_cn":"薄暮丛林最近乱的很，你们非去不可？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x378A91D7A6DFFAC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010638004:1":{"text":"We're going there to fix it!","source_cn":"我们就是去解决乱子的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2628D41120FDCF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010638005:1":{"text":"You...? I guess... Since you're a Wilder, maybe you won't have a problem.","source_cn":"你……好吧。毕竟是绿裔联盟的人，也许不会有问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C6C28C5B5BB1780","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010638006:1":{"text":"Here's the deal. I'll get you there, but I won't do anything else!","source_cn":"不过说好，我只负责送你们过去，其他的事我就不管了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE474A4CDFA72993F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010638007:1":{"text":"Sure, sure.","source_cn":"当然、当然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x026E79DD6E6F6B15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010638008:1":{"text":"Same rules as before then.","source_cn":"那就还是老样子，老规矩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8F32198E20064E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010638009:1":{"text":"Ugh! Please tidy up a bit more. These are my guests, and I can't have them stuffed in the cargo hold like I was!","source_cn":"呃——麻烦你多收拾收拾，这几位是我请的客人，不能让他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAB98447481CC7A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1010638009":{"text":"Ugh! Please tidy up a bit more. These are my guests, and I can't have them stuffed in the cargo hold like I was!","source_cn":"呃——麻烦你多收拾收拾，这几位是我请的客人，不能让他们和我一样